     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "一个让青少年自由快乐的房间",
     "text": "不同储物解决方案确保了这个房间的整洁环境，为青少年提供了展示兴趣爱好和个性风格的空间。来探索精彩创意吧！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250422/b7f0807712c44b6c9ac40ef9f5d8101c.webp",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/gallery/a-teenagers-room-is-a-world-of-its-own-pubefb9da64",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "传统家居风格从梦想变为现实 ",
     "text": "在这间私密温馨的卧室里，美好的旧日梦想与现代生活邂逅，传达出对家居生活的热爱。来感受创意和手工的碰撞吧！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250422/3a72e7f6408d458cbd3b269a3aa45fbc.webp",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/gallery/a-first-home-that-can-last-forever-pub71c841e2",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "色彩缤纷、趣味十足的小家",
     "text": "房间虽然小，却可以满足生活中的物质需求和精神追求，承载人生中的友谊和故事。灵活、创意和个性是整个空间的主旨！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250422/ec21109b85594db39fd214fc130c70db.webp",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/gallery/your-first-own-home-with-room-for-everyone-you-know-pub9ed33410",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
